      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">prefetch 888DFBD65D63BDED696DAD10DD66CFEC4E03650F.zip sha1:888DFBD65D63BDED696DAD10DD66CFEC4E03650F size:96776843 https://update.cyberduck.io/Cyberduck-6.0.0.24625.zip sha256:CE2E001C8667A110D59DECF559F79EC92C1DF7A1AC59EB21D9D3E28DA7767F7E

